2026-11-05 11:13-11:40, #core-sync huddle thread: every clawq turn ended with '[Room not configured] Aborting after repeated identical configuration tool errors' because the agent called github_room_search_items / github_room_list_items / room_memory_list, which fail with 'Room C0CA6UR8FFU has no GitHub item access: empty journal and projections' / 'No memory scope or profile binding found'. B778's stuck detector then aborts the whole turn, so clawq can't answer simple questions in a room with no profile binding. Room-scoped tools that cannot work in an unbound room should not be offered (or their 'not configured' error should not count toward the configuration-class abort).